id: og_hangar_b
name: Hangar II
description: Hangar. A maintenance hangar big enough to lose an argument in, wrapped along one side by crew rooms nobody could stand up straight in. Built as an aircraft maintenance shed; the doors were left half open and the apron lights have been on for a week.

